{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0000", "block": 0, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 29, "sha256": "5e6996c2f4785b9f", "text": "Week 1 — Prompting Techniques"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0001", "block": 1, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 169, "sha256": "25078b4103deb538", "text": "You will practice multiple prompting techniques by crafting prompts to complete specific tasks. Each task’s instructions are at the top of its corresponding source file."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0002", "block": 2, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 12, "sha256": "c3fc54aa5390dc2c", "text": "Installation"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0003", "block": 3, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 86, "sha256": "e5a4a5cbcd653952", "text": "Make sure you have first done the installation described in the top-level `README.md`."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0004", "block": 4, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 19, "sha256": "b60c01198d6f6f3a", "text": "Ollama installation"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0005", "block": 5, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 158, "sha256": "a44df5c23bcdef1f", "text": "We will be using a tool to run different state-of-the-art LLMs locally on your machine called [Ollama](https://ollama.com/). Use one of the following methods:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0006-i00", "block": 6, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 69, "sha256": "0665b92db89dd86f", "text": "macOS (Homebrew): ```bash brew install --cask ollama ollama serve ```"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0007-i00", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 78, "sha256": "da503cbffa1a8db8", "text": "Linux (recommended): ```bash curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh ```"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0008-i00", "block": 8, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 96, "sha256": "9ec0f73cf8051e16", "text": "Windows: Download and run the installer from [ollama.com/download](https://ollama.com/download)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0009", "block": 9, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 20, "sha256": "dfdd92758933d154", "text": "Verify installation:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0010", "block": 10, "kind": "code", "translate": false, "chars": 9, "sha256": "e7151e52a6775ab6", "text": "ollama -v"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0011", "block": 11, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 148, "sha256": "006d62b8e2b01535", "text": "Before running the test scripts, make sure you have the following models pulled. You only need to do this once (unless you remove the models later):"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0012", "block": 12, "kind": "code", "translate": false, "chars": 50, "sha256": "486638afcbbc3e85", "text": "ollama run mistral-nemo:12b\nollama run llama3.1:8b"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0013", "block": 13, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 27, "sha256": "7ec592ab5720cd2b", "text": "Techniques and source files"}
