{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0014-i01", "block": 14, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 46, "sha256": "74b7efe409a18a42", "text": "Chain-of-thought — `week1/chain_of_thought.py`"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0014-i02", "block": 14, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 38, "sha256": "3b81306cbc085766", "text": "Tool calling — `week1/tool_calling.py`"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0014-i03", "block": 14, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 66, "sha256": "60bc478f8f5d4098", "text": "Self-consistency prompting — `week1/self_consistency_prompting.py`"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0014-i04", "block": 14, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 53, "sha256": "029f866900fa2a0d", "text": "RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) — `week1/rag.py`"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0014-i05", "block": 14, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 32, "sha256": "54b544431666e71e", "text": "Reflexion — `week1/reflexion.py`"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0015", "block": 15, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 12, "sha256": "c7ec4b92c29ba226", "text": "Deliverables"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0016-i00", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 39, "sha256": "44e37cca8c94c682", "text": "Read the task description in each file."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0016-i01", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 161, "sha256": "c8bb843ef19ea9d0", "text": "Design and run prompts (look for all the places labeled `TODO` in the code). That should be the only thing you have to change (i.e. don't tinker with the model)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0016-i02", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 56, "sha256": "3daba5e7c0a1c71f", "text": "Iterate to improve results until the test script passes."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0016-i03", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 56, "sha256": "5d37c57b38fecaa2", "text": "Save your final prompt(s) and output for each technique."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0016-i04", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 149, "sha256": "9941af9c69dec5a5", "text": "Make sure to include in your submission the completed code for each prompting technique file. ***Double check that all `TODO`s have been resolved.***"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0017", "block": 17, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 32, "sha256": "f141ef5bcc44e4a1", "text": "Evaluation rubric (60 pts total)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week1-assignmentmd#b0018-i00", "block": 18, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 72, "sha256": "876f6eb842b6004d", "text": "10 for each completed prompt across the 6 different prompting techniques"}
